<mxCell id="q240" value="Cafe East is on the list with no sales and still appears; older MySQL needs a UNION of two anti-joins" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="570" y="230" width="290" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="q241" value="“Pieces and who made them” → inner. “Every potter, and pieces if any” → left. A right join is a left join with the tables swapped." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=12;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="310" width="820" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
